<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26069" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατῐνάσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shake asunder, shake to pieces,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὴν σχεδίην . . διὰ κῦμα τινάξῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.363
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					606
				</span></i>
			: fut.
			
				Med.
			 in pass. sense, ib.<i><span class="en">
				587
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>shake violently,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρα δ. ἄνω κάτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IT</u>
					282
				</span></i>
			; <i>shake out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρώματα</span> Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.63A.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
